<title>GERMANY: German IFO business climate index falls in Dec.</title>
<headline>German IFO business climate index falls in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German IFO economics institute gave the following data from its December business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		     Dec 1996	   Nov 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  95.8		 96.9</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     89.8		 91.4</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   101.8		102.4</p>
<p>    East Germany		     Dec 1996	   Nov 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  104.4		104.8</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     120.9		122.5</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   89.7		 89.5</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
